        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Dr. Bear",
            "We're about 80% there. Some have already been shipped out for fitting on the bionic whales.",
            5
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Mina",
            "And guiding the whale pod?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
